Generic single-database configuration for DoePet PostgreSQL schema migrations using Alembic.

Comandos úteis:
  alembic -c doepet_flask_mysql/alembic.ini current
  alembic -c doepet_flask_mysql/alembic.ini upgrade head
  alembic -c doepet_flask_mysql/alembic.ini revision --autogenerate -m "descricao"
  alembic -c doepet_flask_mysql/alembic.ini downgrade -1
